## **7. Common Findings for Network Assignment Issues**

| Symptom | Likely Cause | Where to Confirm |
|---------|--------------|------------------|
| HTTP `400 Bad Request` | Malformed payload (e.g., missing `networkId`) | Spring logs, proxy, vRA logs |
| HTTP `403 Forbidden` | Permission issue (project lacks network access) | vRA logs, proxy |
| TCP `RST` (reset) | Firewall/network blocking traffic | `tcpdump`, Wireshark |
| SSL handshake failure | Certificate/HTTPS misconfiguration | JVM network logs (`-Djavax.net.debug=ssl`) |
| Timeout | Slow network or vRA unavailability | JVM logs, proxy |

